exports[`rhx clone @<slug> under .agent/actors.yml (integration) given: [case1] a manifest with three declared actors, linked by init when: [t2] \`clone @solo --roles architect\` (a plain role list) then: the refusal holds its shape 1`] = `
"
✋ ConstraintError: a plain role list beside @solo would replace the actor wholesale

{
  "hint": "pass deltas only (+role, -role) beside @solo, or use the inline form for a one-off composition: rhx enroll <brain> --roles <roles>",
  "actor": "@solo"
}

[args] enroll,@solo,--roles,architect

"
`;

